WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.036
Quick Log.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.171
The fastest way to keep a record.

3
00:00:06.171 --> 00:00:08.958
Press N, anywhere in Vantage.

4
00:00:09.408 --> 00:00:13.701
Write it the way you’d say it out loud.

5
00:00:14.908 --> 00:00:18.462
Vantage reads the count, the dollar value

6
00:00:18.462 --> 00:00:23.643
and what kind of value it is, the system, and the date.

7
00:00:24.193 --> 00:00:27.196
Check what it understood, then save.

8
00:00:27.196 --> 00:00:31.007
It lands in your record, dated, and yours.

9
00:00:31.757 --> 00:00:32.699
No signal?

10
00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:37.515
It waits on your device, and syncs when you’re back.
